('110504457165414404','gender/source-domain-conflict','Fanatic: הצל של מי שכאן — לא, אפילו עצם הנוכחות כאן — מכבה את אור הצדק! צריך לגרש את מי שכאן בגלל הכפירה הזאת!',"The actual preceding GetCharacterOnPlace(Fan) domain is Alt (female) or Dude (male). The continuation unconditionally says שלו / הוא עצמו / הכופר. This conflicts with the female occupant and defeats the corrected neutral variable sentence immediately before it. Russian also has a fixed masculine continuation; record that source/domain conflict explicitly rather than treating the source noun or pronoun as evidence that Alt is male. The proposed neutral full unit keeps the occupant's shadow, the self-correction to the occupant's own presence, extinguished righteous light and the demand to expel the heretical resident.",'Compiled Fan_Entrance_Occupied immediately emits this continuation after the corrected dynamic label. Exact configured domain and approved punk-girl female rule; no hypothetical occupants.'),
('110504457157025801','gender/source-domain-conflict','Luka: אני לא רוצה לדחוק אדם אחר. אולי קורת הגג הזאת נחוצה יותר למי שכבר כאן.',"GetCharacterOnPlace(Luka) supplies Greatmother or Teacher (female), Intruder or Jacket (male). The continuation's הוא זקוק fixes the actual resident as male. Russian grammatical человеку / ему does not establish the canonical sex of the resident. Neutral wording must preserve Luka as the person declining to displace the resident and the possibility that the resident needs the roof more.",'Compiled Luka_Entrance_Occupied emits the dynamic occupant sentence, this altruistic explanation, then the request to free a corner.'),
('110504457119277064','number','Nun: גרש אותם כמו שדים, ותשרה עליך הברכה!',"The command is addressed to the one male householder. גרשו and עליכם turn that addressee into a group while the corrected scene-opening line uses singular אצלך. The Russian formal/pious plural imperative remains singular address in this actual exchange. Preserve the resident objects אותם and the prayer register while making the player address singular.",'Compiled Nun_Entrance_Occupied addresses the player at the entrance, names the occupant, admonishes the householder, and offers player eviction/admission choices. No household audience is introduced.'),
('110504457119277063','number','Nun: חיים שלמים לא יספיקו כדי לכפר על חטאיהם! ירא את האל לפני שתתרועע עם שכמותם!',"The imperative יראו and verb שתתרועעו address several people. This branch addresses the one male householder, consistent with its corrected singular אצלך opening. Retain the plural residents/sinners in חטאיהם / שכמותם and the full lifetime-for-atonement sentence; only the addressee should be singular.",'Same actual compiled Nun entrance exchange; player identity and pronoun strategy from the approved glossary.'),
